Collection: Echo
Description: Basic smoke test against postman-echo.com

---

Name: getEcho
Vars:
    url-param: vreq-postman-alternative

Request:
GET {{host}}/get

Query:
hello: world
tenant: {{tenantId}}
page: 1
urlParam: {{url-param}}

Headers:
X-Env: {{tenantId}}
scope: api.scope #override headers scope defined in environment .env

Tests:
- status is 200
- header content-type contains json
- json.path args.hello exists